---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Use">
  <main class="min-h-screen max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <p class="section-label border-b border-accent pb-2 mb-6 inline-block">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold font-display mb-8">Terms of Use</h1>

    <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-6 text-ink-light leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        UnderTheInfluence is provided for public interest research and journalism purposes.
        The data and visualisations are offered as-is, without warranty of any kind.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-display text-ink pt-4">Use of Data</h2>
      <p>
        You are free to cite, reference, and share the data and visualisations from this site
        for journalistic, academic, or non-commercial purposes, with attribution to UnderTheInfluence.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-display text-ink pt-4">Accuracy</h2>
      <p>
        While we strive for accuracy, political data is complex and subject to change.
        We recommend verifying critical data points against the original sources
        (Electoral Commission, MPs' Register of Interests, GOV.UK).
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
